#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UnmountSharesOnExit), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:223 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:231
#, kde-format
msgid "Unmount all personal shares on exit"
msgstr "Demontiraj sva osobna dijeljenja pri izlasku"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UnmountSharesOnExit), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:224 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:232
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Unmount all shares that belong to you when the program exits. Shares that "
"are owned by other users are ignored."
msgstr "Pri izlasku iz programa demontiraj sva dijeljenja koja vam pripadaju. Dijeljenja drugih korisnika zanemaruju se."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (RemountShares), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:228 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:236
#, kde-format
msgid "Remount shares"
msgstr "Ponovno montiraj dijeljenja"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (RemountShares), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:229 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:237
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Remount all your shares that were mounted when you exited the program or "
"changed a profile. If the remounting of a share fails, Smb4K will retry the "
"next time it is started. Shares that were mounted by other users are "
"ignored. Please note that this setting does not affect the automatic "
"remounting of shares when your computer woke up from a sleep state."
msgstr "Ponovno montiraj sva vaša dijeljenja koja su bila montirana pri izlasku iz programa ili promjeni profila. Ako ponovno montiranje ne uspije, Smb4K će pokušati ponovno pri sljedećem pokretanju. Dijeljenja drugih korisnika zanemaruju se. Ova postavka ne utječe na automatsko ponovno montiranje nakon buđenja računala iz stanja mirovanja."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (RemountAttempts), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:233 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:241
#, kde-format
msgid "Number of remount attempts:"
msgstr "Broj pokušaja ponovnog montiranja:"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (RemountAttempts), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:234 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:242
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the number of attempts that are made to remount shares before Smb4K "
"gives up."
msgstr "Postavi broj pokušaja ponovnog montiranja dijeljenja prije nego što Smb4K odustane."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (RemountInterval), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:240 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:248
#, kde-format
msgid "Interval between remount attempts:"
msgstr "Razmak između pokušaja ponovnog montiranja:"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (RemountInterval), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:241 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:249
#, kde-format
msgid "Set the time that elapses between attempts to remount shares."
msgstr "Postavi vrijeme između pokušaja ponovnog montiranja dijeljenja."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (CheckServerOnlineState), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:247 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:255
#, kde-format
msgid "Check the online state of the server before remounting a share"
msgstr "Prije ponovnog montiranja provjeri je li poslužitelj dostupan"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (CheckServerOnlineState), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:248 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:256
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check the online state of the server on which the share to be mounted is "
"located. Smb4K attempts to connect to port 445 of the server. If that fails, "
"no remounting will be done, because the server is most likely down. Switch "
"this option off, if e.g. the server uses non-default ports."
msgstr "Provjeri dostupnost poslužitelja na kojem se nalazi dijeljenje koje treba montirati. Smb4K će se pokušati povezati s njegovim priključkom 445. Ako to ne uspije, dijeljenje se neće ponovno montirati jer poslužitelj vjerojatno nije dostupan. Isključite ovu mogućnost ako poslužitelj koristi nestandardne priključke."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ForceUnmountInaccessible), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:252 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:260
#, kde-format
msgid "Force the unmounting of inaccessible shares"
msgstr "Prisilno demontiraj nedostupna dijeljenja"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ForceUnmountInaccessible), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:253 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:261
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Force the unmounting of inaccessible shares (Linux only). In case a share is "
"inaccessible, a lazy unmount is performed. Before the actual unmount is "
"performed, a warning dialog is shown asking to approve the unmount."
msgstr "Prisilno demontiraj nedostupna dijeljenja (samo Linux). Ako je dijeljenje nedostupno, izvršit će se odgođeno demontiranje. Prije demontiranja prikazat će se upozorenje i zatražiti potvrda."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DetectAllShares), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:257 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:265
#, kde-format
msgid "Detect all shares that are mounted on the system"
msgstr "Otkrij sva montirana dijeljenja na sustavu"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DetectAllShares), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_bsd.kcfg:258 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:266
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You will not only see the shares that were mounted and are owned by you, but "
"also all other mounts using the SMBFS and CIFS file system that are present "
"on the system."
msgstr "Vidjet ćete ne samo dijeljenja koja ste montirali i koja su vaša, nego i sva druga montiranja datotečnim sustavima SMBFS i CIFS na sustavu."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (CifsUnixExtensionsSupport), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:13
#, kde-format
msgid "All or most of the servers support the CIFS Unix extensions"
msgstr "Svi ili većina poslužitelja podržavaju Unixova proširenja CIFS-a"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (CifsUnixExtensionsSupport), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:14
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Most versions of Samba support the CIFS Unix or POSIX extensions. For these "
"servers, some options are not needed, because the right values are "
"negotiated during the mount process. For other servers, you might want to "
"uncheck this option, so that predefined values can be passed to the server. "
"Please note that if your computer is located in a Windows dominated network "
"neighborhood with only a few Samba servers, you can safely uncheck this "
"option and define custom options for the Samba servers."
msgstr "Većina verzija Sambe podržava Unixova ili POSIX proširenja CIFS-a. Za takve poslužitelje neke mogućnosti nisu potrebne jer se odgovarajuće vrijednosti dogovaraju tijekom montiranja. Za ostale poslužitelje možete isključiti ovu mogućnost kako biste im proslijedili unaprijed definirane vrijednosti. Ako se računalo nalazi u mreži kojom prevladava Windows i u kojoj je samo nekoliko poslužitelja Sambe, možete sigurno isključiti ovu mogućnost i definirati prilagođene mogućnosti za te poslužitelje."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseFileMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:24
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is the file mode that will be used for creating files. It must be "
"defined in octal. In case the CIFS file system is used, this setting only "
"takes effect if the server does not support the CIFS Unix Extensions."
msgstr "Ovaj način rada koristit će se pri stvaranju datoteka i mora biti zadan u oktalnom zapisu. Ako se koristi datotečni sustav CIFS, postavka djeluje samo ako poslužitelj ne podržava Unixova proširenja CIFS-a."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FileMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:28
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is the filemode that will be used for creating files. It must be "
"defined in octal. In case the CIFS file system is used, this setting only "
"takes effect if the server does not support the CIFS Unix Extensions."
msgstr "Ovaj način rada datoteke koristit će se pri stvaranju datoteka i mora biti zadan u oktalnom zapisu. Ako se koristi datotečni sustav CIFS, postavka djeluje samo ako poslužitelj ne podržava Unixova proširenja CIFS-a."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseDirectoryMode), group (Mounting)
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DirectoryMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:33 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:37
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is the directory mode that will be used for creating directories. It "
"must be defined in octal. In case the CIFS file system is used, this setting "
"only takes effect if the server does not support the CIFS Unix Extensions."
msgstr "Ovaj način rada direktorija koristit će se pri stvaranju direktorija i mora biti zadan u oktalnom zapisu. Ako se koristi datotečni sustav CIFS, postavka djeluje samo ako poslužitelj ne podržava Unixova proširenja CIFS-a."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseClientCharset), group (Mounting)
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ClientCharset), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:42 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:46
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is the character set that is used by the client side (i.e. your side) "
"either to convert local path names to and from Unicode (CIFS, Linux) or for "
"codepage to charset translations (SMBFS, FreeBSD). If you keep the default "
"setting, Smb4K will try to automatically determine the charset by looking up "
"the \"unix charset\" option in the smb.conf."
msgstr "Ovo je skup znakova koji klijentska strana (odnosno vaša strana) koristi za pretvorbu lokalnih putanja iz Unicodea i u njega (CIFS, Linux) ili za pretvorbu kodnih stranica u skupove znakova (SMBFS, FreeBSD). Ako ostavite zadanu postavku, Smb4K će pokušati automatski odrediti skup znakova provjerom mogućnosti \"unix charset\" u datoteci smb.conf."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseWriteAccess), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Write access:"
msgstr "Pristup za pisanje:"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseWriteAccess), group (Mounting)
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (WriteAccess), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:122 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:126
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose if the shares should be mounted in read-write or read-"
"only mode."
msgstr "Ovdje možete odabrati hoće li se dijeljenja montirati uz pristup za čitanje i pisanje ili samo za čitanje."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (WriteAccess), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:129
#, kde-format
msgid "read-write"
msgstr "čitanje i pisanje"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (WriteAccess), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:132
#, kde-format
msgid "read-only"
msgstr "samo za čitanje"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ForceUID), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:138
#, kde-format
msgid "Definitely assign the UID"
msgstr "Uvijek dodijeli UID"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ForceUID), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:139
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Instruct the client (i.e. your side) to ignore any user ID (UID) provided by "
"the server for files and directories and to always assign the owner to be "
"the value of the transmitted UID."
msgstr "Naloži klijentu (odnosno vašoj strani) da zanemari ID korisnika (UID) koji poslužitelj dodijeli datotekama i direktorijima te da vlasnika uvijek postavi na preneseni UID."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ForceGID), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:143
#, kde-format
msgid "Definitely assign the GID"
msgstr "Uvijek dodijeli GID"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ForceGID), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:144
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Instruct the client (i.e. your side) to ignore any group ID (GID) provided "
"by the server for files and directories and to always assign the owner to be "
"the value of the transmitted GID."
msgstr "Naloži klijentu (odnosno vašoj strani) da zanemari ID grupe (GID) koji poslužitelj dodijeli datotekama i direktorijima te da vlasnika uvijek postavi na preneseni GID."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (PermissionChecks), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:148
#, kde-format
msgid "Do permission checks"
msgstr "Provjeravaj dozvole"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (PermissionChecks), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:149
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The client side (i.e. your side) will check if you have the right UID/GID to "
"manipulate a file or directory. You might want to switch this feature off if "
"the server(s) support the CIFS Unix Extensions and you are not allowed to "
"access the files and directories. This setting does not affect the normal "
"ACL check."
msgstr "Klijentska strana (odnosno vaša strana) provjerit će imate li odgovarajući UID/GID za rad s datotekom ili direktorijem. Ovu značajku možete isključiti ako poslužitelj(i) podržavaju Unixova proširenja CIFS-a, a vama nije dopušten pristup datotekama i direktorijima. Postavka ne utječe na uobičajenu provjeru ACL-a."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ClientControlsIDs), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:153
#, kde-format
msgid "Attempt to set UID and GID"
msgstr "Pokušaj postaviti UID i GID"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ClientControlsIDs), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:154
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In case the server supports the CIFS Unix Extensions, the client side (i.e. "
"your side) attempts to set the effective UID and GID of the current process "
"on newly created files, directories and devices. If this feature is turned "
"off, the server will set the UID and GID to the default for the share. It is "
"recommended that you read the manual page of mount.cifs before you change "
"this setting."
msgstr "Ako poslužitelj podržava Unixova proširenja CIFS-a, klijentska strana (odnosno vaša strana) pokušat će postaviti efektivni UID i GID trenutačnog procesa za nove datoteke, direktorije i uređaje. Ako je ova značajka isključena, poslužitelj će postaviti zadane UID i GID za dijeljenje. Prije promjene ove postavke preporučujemo da pročitate stranicu priručnika za mount.cifs."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ServerInodeNumbers), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:158
#, kde-format
msgid "Use server inode numbers"
msgstr "Koristi brojeve inodea poslužitelja"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ServerInodeNumbers), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:159
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Use inode numbers (unique persistent file identifiers) returned by the "
"server instead of automatically generating temporary inode numbers on the "
"client side."
msgstr "Koristi brojeve inodea (jedinstvene trajne identifikatore datoteka) koje vraća poslužitelj umjesto automatskog stvaranja privremenih brojeva inodea na klijentskoj strani."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (NoLocking), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:163
#, kde-format
msgid "Do not send byte range lock requests"
msgstr "Nemoj slati zahtjeve za zaključavanje raspona bajtova"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (NoLocking), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:164
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do not send byte range lock requests to the server. This is necessary for "
"certain applications that break with CIFS style mandatory byte range locks "
"(and most CIFS servers do not yet support requesting advisory byte range "
"locks)."
msgstr "Nemoj slati poslužitelju zahtjeve za zaključavanje raspona bajtova. To je potrebno za neke aplikacije koje ne rade s obveznim zaključavanjem raspona bajtova u CIFS-u (a većina poslužitelja CIFS-a još ne podržava zahtjeve za savjetodavno zaključavanje raspona bajtova)."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (TranslateReservedChars), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:168
#, kde-format
msgid "Translate reserved characters"
msgstr "Pretvori rezervirane znakove"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (TranslateReservedChars), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:169
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Translate six of the seven reserved characters (including the colon, "
"question mark, pipe, asterisk, greater than and less than characters but not "
"the backslash) to remap range (above 0xF000). This allows you to open files "
"that were created with such characters. This has no effect if the server "
"does not support Unicode."
msgstr "Pretvori šest od sedam rezerviranih znakova (dvotočku, upitnik, okomitu crtu, zvjezdicu, znakove veće i manje od, ali ne i obrnutu kosu crtu) u raspon za preslikavanje (iznad 0xF000). Tako možete otvoriti datoteke stvorene s tim znakovima. Nema učinka ako poslužitelj ne podržava Unicode."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseCacheMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:173
#, kde-format
msgid "Cache mode:"
msgstr "Način predmemoriranja:"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseCacheMode), group (Mounting)
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (CacheMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:174 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:178
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Define how read and write requests are handled. In case you choose to not "
"cache file data at all, the client never utilizes the cache for normal reads "
"and writes. It always accesses the server directly to satisfy a read or "
"write request. If you choose to follow the CIFS/SMB2 protocol strictly, the "
"cache is only trusted if the client holds an oplock. If the client does not "
"hold an oplock, then the client bypasses the cache and accesses the server "
"directly to satisfy a read or write request. Choosing to allow loose caching "
"semantics can sometimes provide better performance on the expense of cache "
"coherency. This option might cause data corruption, if several clients "
"access the same set of files on the server at the same time. Because of "
"this, the strict cache mode is recommended."
msgstr "Odredite kako se obrađuju zahtjevi za čitanje i pisanje. Ako odaberete da se podaci datoteka uopće ne predmemoriraju, klijent neće koristiti predmemoriju za uobičajeno čitanje i pisanje, već će za svaki zahtjev izravno pristupati poslužitelju. Ako odaberete strogo pridržavanje protokola CIFS/SMB2, predmemorija se smatra pouzdanom samo dok klijent drži oplock. Bez oplocka klijent zaobilazi predmemoriju i izravno pristupa poslužitelju. Labavija pravila predmemoriranja ponekad poboljšavaju performanse nauštrb usklađenosti predmemorije. To može oštetiti podatke ako više klijenata istodobno pristupa istim datotekama na poslužitelju. Zato se preporučuje strogi način predmemoriranja."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (CacheMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:181
#, kde-format
msgid "Do not cache file data at all"
msgstr "Uopće ne predmemoriraj podatke datoteka"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (CacheMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:184
#, kde-format
msgid "Follow the CIFS/SMB2 protocol strictly"
msgstr "Strogo se pridržavaj protokola CIFS/SMB2"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (CacheMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:187
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow loose caching semantics"
msgstr "Dopusti labavija pravila predmemoriranja"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseSecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:193
#, kde-format
msgid "Security mode:"
msgstr "Način sigurnosti:"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseSecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:194 smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:198
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Security mode for mount.cifs. To be able to use this mode, the CIFS kernel "
"module 1.40 or later is required."
msgstr "Sigurnosni način za mount.cifs. Za njegovu upotrebu potreban je modul jezgre CIFS 1.40 ili noviji."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:201
#, kde-format
msgid "Connect as a null user (no name)"
msgstr "Poveži se kao anonimni korisnik (bez imena)"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:204
#, kde-format
msgid "Kerberos 5 authentication"
msgstr "Autentifikacija Kerberos 5"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:207
#, kde-format
msgid "Kerberos 5 authentication and packet signing"
msgstr "Autentifikacija Kerberos 5 i potpisivanje paketa"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:210
#, kde-format
msgid "NTLM protocol"
msgstr "Protokol NTLM"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:213
#, kde-format
msgid "NTLM protocol and packet signing"
msgstr "Protokol NTLM i potpisivanje paketa"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:216
#, kde-format
msgid "NTLMv2 protocol"
msgstr "Protokol NTLMv2"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:219
#, kde-format
msgid "NTLMv2 protocol and packet signing"
msgstr "Protokol NTLMv2 i potpisivanje paketa"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:222
#, kde-format
msgid "NTLMSSP protocol"
msgstr "Protokol NTLMSSP"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SecurityMode), group (Mounting)
#: smb4kmountsettings_linux.kcfg:225
#, kde-format
msgid "NTLMSSP protocol and packet signing"
msgstr "Protokol NTLMSSP i potpisivanje paketa"

#: smb4knotification.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid "The share <b>%1</b> has been mounted to <b>%2</b>."
msgstr "Dijeljenje <b>%1</b> montirano je u <b>%2</b>."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:78
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Open the contents of the share with the file manager"
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Otvori"

#: smb4knotification.cpp:83
#, kde-format
msgid "The share %1 has been mounted to %2."
msgstr "Dijeljenje %1 montirano je u %2."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:102
#, kde-format
msgid "The share <b>%1</b> has been unmounted from <b>%2</b>."
msgstr "Dijeljenje <b>%1</b> demontirano je iz <b>%2</b>."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:110
#, kde-format
msgid "The share %1 has been unmounted from %2."
msgstr "Dijeljenje %1 demontirano je iz %2."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:123 smb4knotification.cpp:131
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 share has been mounted."
msgid_plural "%1 shares have been mounted."
msgstr[0] "Montirano je %1 dijeljenje."
msgstr[1] "Montirana su %1 dijeljenja."
msgstr[2] "Montirano je %1 dijeljenja."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:144 smb4knotification.cpp:152
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 share has been unmounted."
msgid_plural "%1 shares have been unmounted."
msgstr[0] "Demontirano je %1 dijeljenje."
msgstr[1] "Demontirana su %1 dijeljenja."
msgstr[2] "Demontirano je %1 dijeljenja."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:166 smb4knotification.cpp:171
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The way Smb4K stores the login credentials has changed. They will now be "
"migrated. This change is incompatible with earlier versions of Smb4K."
msgstr "Promijenio se način na koji Smb4K pohranjuje vjerodajnice za prijavu. Sada će se prenijeti u novi format. Ova promjena nije kompatibilna sa starijim verzijama Smb4Ka."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:190
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The mimetype <b>%1</b> is not supported for printing. Please convert the "
"file to PDF or Postscript and try again."
msgstr "Vrsta MIME <b>%1</b> nije podržana za ispis. Pretvorite datoteku u PDF ili PostScript pa pokušajte ponovno."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:194
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The mimetype %1 is not supported for printing. Please convert the file to "
"PDF or Postscript and try again."
msgstr "Vrsta MIME %1 nije podržana za ispis. Pretvorite datoteku u PDF ili PostScript pa pokušajte ponovno."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:214
#, kde-format
msgid "The bookmark for share <b>%1</b> already exists and will be skipped."
msgstr "Knjižna oznaka za dijeljenje <b>%1</b> već postoji i bit će preskočena."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:218
#, kde-format
msgid "The bookmark for share %1 already exists and will be skipped."
msgstr "Knjižna oznaka za dijeljenje %1 već postoji i bit će preskočena."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:237
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The label <b>%1</b> of the bookmark for the share <b>%2</b> is already being "
"used and will automatically be renamed."
msgstr "Oznaka <b>%1</b> knjižne oznake za dijeljenje <b>%2</b> već se koristi i automatski će se preimenovati."

#: smb4knotification.cpp:243
